You can move Commander Keen with the joystick or keyboard.


When you first start Keen, you will be in keyboard mode. Let's look at the keys you need to know to play the game.

KEY           WHAT IT DOES

Arrows        Move Keen around

Ctrl          Jump

Alt           Use Pogo/Stop Pogo

Ctrl AND Alt  Fire pistol               (if any charges left)

You can redefine these keys by pressing F3.


OTHER IMPORTANT KEYS

Spacebar      Status screen

F1            Help!

F2            Sound on/off

F3            Keyboard mode

F4            Joystick mode

F5            Save Game 	      (do this often!)

ESC           Quit to Title Screen               or DOS


If you use the joystick, use button 1 to jump, button 2 to use the pogo, and both to fire a pistol.  Controlling Keen while using the pogo is more difficult.

When you are on the world map, you may be blocked by a village, city, or other obstacle.  You must enter the city (press Ctrl or button 1) and finish it before proceeding.

When you enter a city, you can get things by simply running into them.

If you cannot pass through a door, there may be a "keycard" that the door requires.  This keycard will be the same color as the door.

If you cannot get somewhere, you may have to activate a bridge or find some other way to get where you need to go.


